WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:04,420
Forget it, what's wrong with him? He just wanted to give me protein.

2
00:00:04,420 --> 00:00:09,030
The hospital of Hard Family is looking for adoptive families for small animals that are easy to adopt.

3
00:00:09,030 --> 00:00:13,620
If they are difficult to adopt, let them live in the garden of the Hard Home. I will take care of the head and tail.

4
00:00:13,620 --> 00:00:16,230
There is a strange medicinal smell

5
00:00:16,230 --> 00:00:18,730
Is anyone around you sick?

6
00:00:18,730 --> 00:00:20,012
No

7
00:00:20,012 --> 00:00:20,867
Wrong

8
00:00:20,867 --> 00:00:25,141
Today youyou met a brother

9
00:00:25,141 --> 00:00:26,850
He is so strange

10
00:00:26,850 --> 00:00:31,840
He looks like this

11
00:00:31,840 --> 00:00:33,840
Abstract lines, peculiar shapes

12
00:00:33,840 --> 00:00:36,840
The painting style of soul out of body, Biga Suo has to shout six when he comes

13
00:00:36,840 --> 00:00:39,840
I knew that my beautiful brother was just as stupid as me

14
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:45,250
He said he wanted to be friends with Yuyou, but Yuyou didn't like him

15
00:00:45,250 --> 00:00:51,870
Beautiful brother, Yoyo just wants to be good friends with you

16
00:00:51,870 --> 00:00:53,870
How could he say such things so casually?

17
00:00:53,870 --> 00:00:57,860
Do you want to be good friends with Yoyo?

18
00:00:57,860 --> 00:01:05,220
Baby, he seems to be in danger of death

19
00:01:05,220 --> 00:01:10,220
A human cub can turn so red. Is he a relative of a chameleon?

20
00:01:10,220 --> 00:01:14,220
Baby, don't play with this little fool, I have a fluffy tail.

21
00:01:14,220 --> 00:01:18,220
If he doesn't speak, he refuses. He doesn't want to be a good friend with you at all.

22
00:01:18,220 --> 00:01:20,220
He dislikes you, he hates you

23
00:01:20,220 --> 00:01:23,670
What, when my brother hates Yoyo

24
00:01:23,670 --> 00:01:26,670
No, when did I say I hate Yoyo?

25
00:01:26,670 --> 00:01:29,700
YoYo heartbroken

26
00:01:29,700 --> 00:01:36,640
I, I don’t, why don’t I hate you?

27
00:01:36,640 --> 00:01:40,770
This, really, I want to be good friends with you

28
00:01:40,770 --> 00:01:44,050
I knew it
